# Project core

- Stack: Rust `big-market-rs/` — `bm-gateway` :8080, `bm-app` :8083, optional `bm-worker` :8085.
- Docs: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/FLOWS.md`, `docs/DATA.md`, `docs/OPERATIONS.md`.
- Frontend: `big-market-web` → `http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1`.
- `bm-app` must not own MQ consumers / credit dispatch (worker / embed scheduler only).
- Prefer code + SQL over stale docs; update docs when behavior changes.
- Commit only when the user asks.
